# Dynamic feature definition for the LG 27UN880 ("LG HDR 4K").
# The monitor's capability string advertises a bogus value list for feature 15
# (01 06 11 13 14 15 18 19 28 29 48); the picture mode codes it actually
# reports and accepts were found empirically by dumping all features in each
# mode and diffing.
MCCS_VERSION 2.1
MFG_ID GSM
MODEL LG HDR 4K
PRODUCT_CODE 30544

FEATURE_CODE x15 Picture Mode
ATTRS RW NC
VALUE x0B Custom
VALUE x27 HDR
